{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":30.079999923706055,"text":"Honestly, my whole weekend is in this bag right now. This is the Weekender from Vellantra. It's a Birkin inspired shape that they scaled up into a travel bag and there's no logo on it anywhere. Jacket's Veronica Beard, trousers are Frame, and the hat has no label. The cluff is David Yerman and the watch is a Rolex. It holds three days worth of clothes and it still fits in the overhead bin, which is all I need.","words":[{"word":"Honestly","start":1.0800000429153442,"end":1.6799999475479126},{"word":"my","start":1.6799999475479126,"end":1.9800000190734863},{"word":"whole","start":1.9800000190734863,"end":2.380000114440918},{"word":"weekend","start":2.380000114440918,"end":2.5199999809265137},{"word":"is","start":2.5199999809265137,"end":2.8399999141693115},{"word":"in","start":2.8399999141693115,"end":2.9600000381469727},{"word":"this","start":2.9600000381469727,"end":3.180000066757202},{"word":"bag","start":3.180000066757202,"end":3.359999895095825},{"word":"right","start":3.359999895095825,"end":3.680000066757202},{"word":"now","start":3.680000066757202,"end":4.380000114440918},{"word":"This","start":4.639999866485596,"end":4.760000228881836},{"word":"is","start":4.760000228881836,"end":4.900000095367432},{"word":"the","start":4.900000095367432,"end":5.139999866485596},{"word":"Weekender","start":5.139999866485596,"end":5.519999980926514},{"word":"from","start":5.519999980926514,"end":6.039999961853027},{"word":"Vellantra","start":6.039999961853027,"end":6.739999771118164},{"word":"It's","start":7.179999828338623,"end":7.400000095367432},{"word":"a","start":7.400000095367432,"end":7.820000171661377},{"word":"Birkin","start":7.820000171661377,"end":7.960000038146973},{"word":"inspired","start":7.960000038146973,"end":8.579999923706055},{"word":"shape","start":8.579999923706055,"end":8.960000038146973},{"word":"that","start":8.960000038146973,"end":9.180000305175781},{"word":"they","start